<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Armon et al. (2011) Science / Efrati et al. (2009) JMPS Incompatible Shell Elasticity & Chiral Seed Pod Opening — Model fidelity to source: 95/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements orthogonal +-45 deg sclerenchyma bilayer hygroscopic shrinkage Delta_eps_hygro -> kappa_0 (`compute_sclerenchyma_bilayer_kappa0`, L138-150), rotated saddle target curvature tensor b_0(theta) with Gauss incompatibility det(b_0) = -kappa_0^2 < 0 (`compute_target_curvature_tensor`, L152-186), exact Föppl-von Kármán critical width w_tilde_c = (16*(1+nu)/sqrt(1-nu^2))^(1/4) (`critical_fvk_width`, L188-194), and an L-BFGS-B non-Euclidean plate energy minimizer (`relax_incompatible_ribbon_equilibrium`, L253-389) with negative controls at kappa_0 = 0 and theta = 0 deg, 90 deg, backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_065_chiral_seed_pod_opening.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-model-fidelity-1>,
