        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.5e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Armon et al. (2011) Science / Efrati et al. (2009) JMPS Incompatible Shell Elasticity & Chiral Seed Pod Opening — Morphometric validation: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1053-1154) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with uncertainty and statistical tests: critical width w_tilde_c = 2.1609 (ref 2.1609), saddle Gaussian target curvature det(b_0) = -0.1764 cm^-2 (ref -0.1764), pitchfork mean curvature H*(w_tilde)/kappa_0 Pearson r = 1.0000 (RMSE = 0.0006), helix radius R(w_tilde)*kappa_0 Pearson r = 1.0000 (RMSE = 0.0022), helical pitch P(w_tilde)*kappa_0/(2*pi) Pearson r = 1.0000 (RMSE = 0.0027), cutting-angle torsion tau(theta)/kappa_0 Pearson r = 1.0000, achiral ring pitch control P(theta=0 deg) = 0.000000 cm (ref 0.0), 4-system helical pitch Pearson r = 0.9994 (RMSE = 0.1771 cm), and *Bauhinia variegata* specimen half-pitch CV = 0.2405." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-4-system-legume-biomimetic-latex-helical-pitch-p-correlation-bauhinia-erythrina-latex>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-achiral-ring-negative-control-helical-pitch-p-at-cutting-angle-theta-0-deg>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-armon-et-al-2011-critical-f-ppl-von-k-rm-n-pitchfork-width-w-tilde-c-nu-0-30>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-bauhinia-variegata-specimen-segmented-helical-lobe-half-pitch-cv-bauhinia-chiral-seed-pod-specimen-jpg>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-cutting-angle-chirality-torsion-tau-theta-kappa-0-correlation-across-theta-in-0-deg-90-deg>,
