    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Armon et al. (2011) Science / Efrati et al. (2009) JMPS Incompatible Shell Elasticity & Chiral Seed Pod Opening — MorphoEval overall 93.4/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2007-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening.py` (overall weighted score: 93.4/100, up from 55.8/100 in v1). The remediated script minimizes the non-Euclidean incompatible plate energy functional E = E_stretch + E_bend across dimensionless width w_tilde in [0.5, 10] via L-BFGS-B relaxation; reproduces the supercritical pitchfork bifurcation at w_tilde_c = 2.1609 separating narrow Pure-Twist Helicoids (H = 0, R = 0) from wide Cylindrical Helical Ribbons (r_H = 1.0000, r_R = 1.0000, r_P = 1.0000); validates the cutting-angle chirality sweep theta in [0 deg, 90 deg] including theta = 0 deg and 90 deg achiral circular ring controls (P = 0.000000 cm) and 4-system scaling (r_P = 0.9994); and segments the SHA-256-locked Bauhinia variegata specimen image (8 helical twist lobes, CV = 0.2405). Overall 93.4/100 (faithfulness 93.1, reproducibility 94.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 95, Morphological realism / specimen match 91, Parameter expressivity 93, Morphometric validation 94, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 93, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: docs/media/chiral_seed_pod_opening_comparison.png: rendered output of 2007-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening.py at 8871db0, image/png, 1024373 B, 2775×1680 px, artifact_sha256 1ecbc4345db11d57bc9065ca3dd64a4879b90e1d271e93ba5fb6592f35825c3e (sha256 1ecbc4345db11d57bc9065ca3dd64a4879b90e1d271e93ba5fb6592f35825c3e), spec_fingerprint 48029999be49f27cab48fdb5ee4f4512dc98d25ab053a5439aec7a9ce898cd3a. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 48029999be49f27cab48fdb5ee4f4512dc98d25ab053a5439aec7a9ce898cd3a; artifact_sha256: 1ecbc4345db11d57bc9065ca3dd64a4879b90e1d271e93ba5fb6592f35825c3e; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/bauhinia_chiral_seed_pod_specimen.jpg=047f357961bc58c5..., datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/chiral_seed_pod_opening_reference.json=4b1fa5df06327c65..., datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/paper_citations.bib=b3a693ac6a538b04..., datasets/chiral_seed_pod_opening/scout_manifest.json=05711e5e7df6cb17...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-chiral-seed-pod-opening-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the quasi-static non-Euclidean shell energy minimizer to transient elastodynamic fracture propagation along the pod suture line to model ballistic seed ejection velocities." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.34e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

